			"notes": "## Changes\n\n- Ported the mod to Minecraft 26.1.x, targeting Fabric only\n- Dropped Quilt, NeoForge, and the Architectury multi-loader setup; collapsed everything into a single Fabric module\n- Updated all mixins to match Minecraft 26.1 official mappings (GuiGraphicsExtractor rendering API, MouseButtonEvent/MouseButtonInfo, Identifier, ObjectSelectionList API changes, etc.)\n- Updated cloth-config integration for the new config screen API\n- Bumped Fabric Loader requirement to >=0.18.4\n- Mod now declares compatibility with any Minecraft 26.1.x release (`>=26.1 <26.2`)\n- Verified working in-game with a real-world mod profile (Sodium, Lithium, ModernFix, and others)\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Minecraft 26.1.x\n- Fabric Loader >=0.18.4\n- Fabric API\n- Cloth Config"
